ass="element__image-hotspot--content-title">Wide Compatibility</h3><div class="element__image-hotspot--content-text ecom-html">The Wide Compatibility feature of the iPhone wireless charger ensures it works with various smartphones and Qi-enabled devices, simplifying your charging needs. From iPhones to Samsung Galaxies and Google Pixels, this charger offers convenient wireless charging for a wide range of devices, making it an essential accessory for any tech enthusiast.<div></div></div><div class="ecom__image-hostpot--content-container ecom-button-default"></div></div></div></div><div class="element__image-hotspot--text ecom-pa ecom-flex ecom-fl_center ecom-al_center" data-source="custom" data-limit="10" data-stopdrag="" style="left: 28%; top: 60%;"><div class="element__image-hotspot--btn ecom-flex ecom-fl_center ecom-al_center" style="cursor: pointer;"><div class="element__image-hotspot--btn-icon ecom-flex ecom-fl_center ecom-al_center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="10" fill="#44E436"></circle><path d="M13.4286 10.5714H6.57143C6.22857 10.5714 6 10.3429 6 10C6 9.65714 6.22857 9.42857 6.57143 9.42857H13.4286C13.7714 9.42857 14 9.65714 14 10C14 10.3429 13.7714 10.5714 13.4286 10.5714Z" fill="black"></path><path d="M10 14C9.65714 14 9.42857 13.7714 9.42857 13.4286V6.57143C9.42857 6.22857 9.65714 6 10 6C10.3429 6 10.5714 6.22857 10.5714 6.57143V13.4286C10.5714 13.7714 10.3429 14 10 14Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="element__image-hotspot--btn-label">Easy To Carry</div></div><div class="element__image-hotspot--content element__image-hotspot--content-right has-arrow arrow-right slide" tabindex="0"><div class="ecom-hotspots-container-tooltip"><img class="element__image-hotspot--content-image" loading="lazy"><h3 class="element__image-hotspot--content-title">Feature Easy To Carry</h3><div class="element__image-hotspot--content-text ecom-html">The Easy To Carry 